  "title": "ieee80211: Look for mesh control field in the decrypted frame.",
  "description": "IEEE Std 802.11-2020 9.2.4.7.3 Mesh Control Field:\n\tWhen the frame body contains an MSDU (or a fragment thereof) and\n\tthe frame is encrypted, the Mesh Control field is located in the\n\tfirst octets of the encrypted data portion.\n\nCheck for Mesh Control field at the start of decrypted data and add Mesh\nControl field in the proper location.\n\n[mesh_encrypted_data.pcapng](/uploads/eefeccdec77bcebd23c88144e87c69f9/mesh_encrypted_data.pcapng)\nKey to decrypt this capture: `7f361d4246f054c8e34c820e41678102`",
